# Extracted from previous-runs/world-20260821-212736.log. What it proves:
#
#   * 0x013B carries a COUNT and the server ignored it. The request asks for 3
#     (940e8711 tick, e8030000 skill 1000, 03000000 count 3) and the reply says
#     'raised 0 -> 1'. Wisp: 'I tried to bulk add 3 points into Three Snails, but
#     it only went up 1 point.'
#   * the recovery trailer WAS sent on every idle regen tick and drew no number -
#     which is what makes the blue number a clean NEGATIVE rather than a packet
#     that never went out.
#   * the client claimed 1 damage on every hit while the server computed more.

332:01:21:05.577 -> 0x007C STAT_CHANGED (u8 excl, u8 quiet, u8 1, u32 mask, fields in bit order) StatChanged: hit by mob 2003 (template 2, attack index -1) for 3 - hp 178 -> 175. The CLIENT claimed 1 and the server overrode it. Bit 10 carries the NEW HP, not a delta.
